*.pdb

# OS
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment output.  This project is deliberately code-only: descriptors,
# distance matrices, recognition results and figures are all regenerable by
# re-running the pipeline, and the datasets are obtained from their original
# sources (see README).  Keeping them out is what stops the repository
# ballooning the way the original workspace did.
#
# If you ever need to commit one on purpose:  git add -f <file>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mat
*.fig
*.tif
*.tiff
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.avi
*.mp4

# Raw dataset files
*.c3d
*.C3D
*.bvh
*.amc
*.sign
*.tsd
*.tagstream
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.txt.skeleton
*.skeleton
*.bin

# Visual Studio build artefacts (loghog/src)
*.sdf
*.suo
*.VC.db
ipch/
Debug/
x64/

# Portable validation runtime artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
build/

# Local AI workflow, review, recovery and validation notes
/AGENTS.md
/REVIEW.md
/docs/MEX_RECOVERY.md
/docs/OCTAVE_VALIDATION.md
/docs/SPARSE_DICTIONARY_FIX.md
